.TH SHUTDOWN 3
.SH NAME
shutdown \- libc wrapper for local socket shutdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/socket.h>
.PP
.B int shutdown(int socket, int how);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The libc wrapper disables reception, transmission, or both directions of a
connected AF_UNIX SOCK_STREAM socketpair and sets errno on failure.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero on success, or -1 on error.
